setting_play_volume_balancer_tip:
Brings down tracks that are louder than the rest so the volume no longer jumps between songs.

Please note:
1. Enabling this turns off "Enable audio offload", which increases power consumption;
2. It takes effect after restarting the app completely;
3. It relies on system audio effects, so it may not be available on Android 8 or earlier and on some devices.
